sequenceDiagram
    participant A as External database author
    participant D as Workflow store
    participant T as Trusted delivery provider
    participant F as Private identity state
    participant S as Source provider
    participant R as Independent native reviewer
    participant C as Jenkins / exact-tree merge
    A->>D: Submit leased code
    D->>T: Admit prepare action
    T->>T: Validate quarantine
    T->>S: Acquire
    S-->>T: ArtifactManifest
    T->>F: Persist identity
    F-->>T: Durable
    T->>T: Bundle and import
    T->>D: Publish context
    D->>R: Lease review
    R->>S: Acquire
    S-->>R: ArtifactManifest
    alt v2 content matches
        R->>R: Verify scope / policy
        R->>D: Bound verdict
    else Mismatch
        R->>D: Reject before CI
    end
    opt Approved candidate
        D->>T: Admit delivery
        T->>C: Submit exact candidate
        C-->>T: CI / merge receipts
        T->>D: Commit outcome
    end
    Note over T,R: Git is provenance and delivery
    Note over A,C: Content equality never grants approval or skips CI
